<p>Oh, and uh, I usually <em>don't</em> do shameless self promotion in author posts&#8230; but they're author posts. So I am allowed to. <a href="/scp-1549">SCP-1549</a> &lt;&#8212; Another SCP I made recently that I think hasn't gotten much attention. It was posted in close proximity to a Kaktus skip on a week day, so that might have something to do with it, but still. It has some glowing reviews in the comments, and it would be nice if it just got more eyes. Also, if you think that I made cute crows, you might think I'm good at making beetles cute as well. You'll never know if you don't try it out, so if you want to see for yourself here is a handy link: <a href="/scp-3018">SCP-3018</a> That's enough self promotion for one author's post. Check out my author's page if you like me in general. See y'all!</p>
